			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 736740301,
					"content": "小家伙，不是你带我来的吗？来点作用，再动一动啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740302,
					"content": "唉，行吧，你就待着别动吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740303,
						736740304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740303,
					"content": "乌尔曼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 736740305,
					"content": "旅行者？嘿哟，真是好久不见了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740306,
					"content": "怎么？你还在满世界转悠吗？我可是听说了你的不少惊天事迹，你可真是身手不凡啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740307,
					"content": "嘿嘿，这次你来须弥，又是打算来解决什么问题？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740308,
						736740310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740308,
					"content": "你说点吉利的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740309
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 736740309,
					"content": "行行，说正经的。旅行者，这次咱们再合作一下，怎么样？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740313,
					"content": "你看，这片须弥大地，可是处处都是宝藏，哪里都有摩拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740314,
					"content": "我的这个体质嘛…也正常发挥，吸引了不少仙灵过来，里面也有你我熟悉无比的「寻宝仙灵」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740315,
					"content": "还是和之前一样，你负责和仙灵去寻宝，我负责给你准备报酬。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740316,
					"content": "只要我们联手，绝对能再大大地赚上一笔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740317,
						736740321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740317,
					"content": "这次又要找「铁钱」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740318
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 736740318,
					"content": "那不是，这次我要找的是比「铁钱」更值钱的「古铁钱」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740319,
					"content": "就多了一个字吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740320
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 736740320,
					"content": "你别小看这一个字啊，多一个字，能多卖不少摩拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740326,
					"content": "那这件事就这么定了，咱们和之前一样通力合作，狠狠地再大赚一笔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740321,
					"content": "除了我你就找不到别人吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740322
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 736740322,
					"content": "哎呀…挑合作伙伴，当然要挑自己最熟悉的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740323,
					"content": "再说了，你我朋友一场，有这种好事，我怎么能让肥水流外人田呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740324,
					"content": "一段时间不见，嘴皮子变利索了嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740325
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 736740325,
					"content": "嘿嘿嘿，我拿着那些宝贝去找买主，必须要学会说话嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "乌尔曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 736740310,
					"content": "我先把你给解决了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						736740311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 736740311,
